-- Living Room — 5m × 4m
-- A typical living room with sofa facing the TV

ROOM 5.0 4.0 2.7

DOOR north @2.5 w:0.9
WINDOW east @2.0 w:1.2 h:1.4

-- Seating
SOFA 3seat @1.0 0.5 facing:east
SOFA armchair @0.3 3.0 facing:south

-- Tables
TABLE coffee @2.0 1.5

-- Entertainment
TV 55 @3.7 2.0 wall:east

-- Decor
RUG medium @1.2 0.8
LAMP floor @0.2 0.2
